hadiths[39]{hadithnumber,text}:
"287","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jamaat ki Namaz akele ki Namaz se sattais darjon se afzal hai."
"288","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jamaat ki Namaz tum mein se kisi ki akele Namaz se pachees hisson se afzal hai."
"289","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, maine irada kya ke lakdiyon ka hukm dun aur lakdiyan jama ki jain, phir Namaz ka hukm dun aur us ke liye azaan di jaye, phir aik shakhs ko hukm dun jo logon ki imamat kare, phir un mardon ki taraf ja kar un par un ke ghar jala dun."
"290","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Busr bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Zaid bin Sabit ne kaha ke tumhari sab se afzal Namaz tumhare gharon mein tumhari Namaz hai siwa farz Namaz ke."
"291","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Harmala Aslami se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hamare aur munafiqon ke darmiyan Isha aur Fajr mein hazri hai, wo dono ki taqat nahi rakhte. Ya is jaisa farmaya."
"292","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ke ghulam Sumay se, unhon ne Abu Salih se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik shakhs raste mein chal raha tha jab us ne raste mein kaanton ki tehni pai to use hata diya, to Allah ne us ka shukr ada kya aur use bakhsh diya. Aur farmaya ke shaheed paanch hain, taaun wala aur pet wala aur doobne wala aur malbe wala aur Allah ki raah mein shaheed. Aur farmaya ke agar log jante ke azaan aur pehli saf mein kya hai phir is par qura andazi ke siwa kuchh na pate to us par qura andazi karte, aur agar jante ke jaldi karne mein kya hai to us ki taraf daudte, aur agar jante ke Isha aur Fajr mein kya hai to un mein aate chahe ghisat kar."
"293","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Sulaiman bin Abi Hathma se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne Sulaiman bin Abi Hathma ko Fajr ki Namaz mein na paya, aur Umar bin Khattab subah bazaar ki taraf gae, aur Sulaiman ka ghar bazaar aur Masjid-e-Nabvi ke darmiyan tha, to Shifa Umm Sulaiman ke paas se guzre aur un se kaha ke maine Sulaiman ko Fajr mein na dekha, to unhon ne kaha ke wo raat bhar Namaz padhte rahe aur un ki aankh ghalib aa gai. To Umar ne kaha ke mere liye Fajr ki Namaz jamaat mein hazir hona is se zyada pasand hai ke main raat bhar qiyam karun."
"294","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abi Amra Ansari se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Usman bin Affan Isha ki Namaz mein aae aur masjid walon ko thoda dekha to masjid ke pichhle hisse mein let gae aur logon ka intezar karne lage ke zyada hon, phir Ibn Abi Amra un ke paas aae aur un ke paas baithe to unhon ne un se pucha ke tum kaun ho, to unhon ne unhein bataya, phir kaha ke tumhare paas Quran mein se kya hai, to unhon ne unhein bataya. To Usman ne un se kaha ke jo Isha mein hazir hua goya us ne aadhi raat qiyam kya, aur jo Fajr mein hazir hua goya us ne puri raat qiyam kya."
"295","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Banu Deel mein se aik shakhs se jise Busr bin Mihjan kaha jata hai, unhon ne apne walid Mihjan se riwayat kya ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik majlis mein they to Namaz ke liye azaan di gai, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khade hue aur Namaz padhi phir laute jab ke Mihjan apni majlis mein they aur unhon ne Aap ke sath Namaz na padhi thi, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke tumhein logon ke sath Namaz padhne se kis ne roka, kya tum musalman shakhs nahi ho. To unhon ne kaha ke kyun nahi ya Rasulullah, lekin maine apne ghar walon mein Namaz padh li hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke jab aao to logon ke sath Namaz padho chahe tum padh chuke ho."
"296","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Abdullah bin Umar se sawal kya aur kaha ke main apne ghar mein Namaz padhta hun phir Imam ke sath Namaz pata hun to kya main us ke sath Namaz padhun, to Abdullah bin Umar ne un se kaha ke haan. Us shakhs ne kaha ke in dono mein se kisi ko apni Namaz banaun, to Ibn Umar ne un se kaha ke kya ye tumhare paas hai, ye sirf Allah ke paas hai, wo jis mein se chahe banae."
"297","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Saeed bin Musayyab se sawal kya aur kaha ke main apne ghar mein Namaz padhta hun phir masjid aata hun aur Imam ko Namaz padhte pata hun to kya main us ke sath Namaz padhun, to Saeed ne kaha ke haan. Us shakhs ne kaha ke in dono mein se meri Namaz kaunsi hai, to Saeed ne kaha ke kya tum in dono ko banate ho, ye sirf Allah ke paas hai."
"298","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Afeef Sahmi se, unhon ne Banu Asad mein se aik shakhs se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abu Ayyub Ansari se sawal kya aur kaha ke main apne ghar mein Namaz padhta hun phir masjid aata hun aur Imam ko Namaz padhte pata hun to kya main us ke sath Namaz padhun, to Abu Ayyub ne kaha ke haan, us ke sath Namaz padho, kyunke jo aisa kare us ke liye jama karne wale ke hisse jaisa ya jama karne wale ke hisse jaisa hissa hai."
"299","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jo Maghrib ya Fajr padhe phir in dono ko Imam ke sath pae to in dono ko na dohrae. Malik ne kaha ke main harj nahi samajhta ke jo apne ghar mein padh chuka ho wo Imam ke sath Namaz padhe siwa Maghrib ki Namaz ke, kyunke jab wo use dohrae ga to jora ho jaye gi."
"300","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi logon ko Namaz padhae to halki kare kyunke un mein kamzor aur beemar aur bada hai, aur jab tum mein se koi apne liye Namaz padhe to jitna chahe lambi kare."
"301","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main aik Namaz mein Abdullah bin Umar ke peechhe khada hua jab ke un ke sath mere siwa koi na tha to Abdullah ne apne haath se mujhe mukhalif kya aur mujhe apne barabar kar diya."
"302","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs Aqiq mein logon ki imamat karta tha to Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne us ki taraf bhej kar use mana kya. Malik ne kaha ke unhon ne use sirf is liye mana kya kyunke us ka baap pehchana na jata tha."
"303","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghode par sawaar hue aur gir gae aur Aap ka daayan pehlu chhil gaya, phir Aap ne Namazon mein se aik Namaz baith kar padhi aur hum ne Aap ke peechhe baith kar Namaz padhi, phir jab Aap phire to farmaya ke Imam sirf is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairvi ki jaye, phir jab wo khada Namaz padhe to khade Namaz padho, aur jab ruku kare to ruku karo, aur jab sar uthae to sar uthao, aur jab kahe ke Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne us ki hamd ki to kaho ke aey hamare Rab aur tere liye hamd hai, aur jab baith kar Namaz padhe to sab mil kar baith kar Namaz padho."
"304","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhi jab ke Aap beemar they to baith kar Namaz padhi aur Aap ke peechhe qoum ne khade ho kar Namaz padhi to unhein ishara kya ke baith jao, phir jab Aap phire to farmaya ke Imam sirf is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki pairvi ki jaye, phir jab ruku kare to ruku karo, aur jab sar uthae to sar uthao, aur jab baith kar Namaz padhe to baith kar Namaz padho."
"305","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni bimari mein nikle aur aae aur Abu Bakr ko paya jab ke wo khade logon ko Namaz padha rahe they to Abu Bakr peechhe hate to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein ishara kya ke jaisey ho waisey raho, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu Bakr ke pehlu mein baith gae, phir Abu Bakr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz se Namaz padhte they jab ke wo baithe they aur log Abu Bakr ki Namaz se Namaz padhte they."
"306","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ismail bin Muhammad bin Saad bin Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne Amr bin Aas ya Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas ke ghulam se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se kisi ki baith kar Namaz khade ho kar us ki Namaz ke aadhe jaisi hai."
"307","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jab hum Madina aae to humein wahan ke bukhar ki sakht waba pahunchi, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke paas nikle jab ke wo apni nafl mein baith kar Namaz padh rahe they to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke baithne wale ki Namaz khade hone wale ki Namaz ke aadhe jaisi hai."
"308","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saib bin Yazeed se, unhon ne Muttalib bin Abi Wadaa Sahmi se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Hafsa se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi apni nafl mein baith kar Namaz padhte na dekha yahan tak ke wafaat se aik saal pehle hua, to Aap apni nafl mein baith kar Namaz padhte they aur surat padh kar thahar thahar kar padhte yahan tak ke wo sab se lambi se zyada lambi hoti."
"309","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi raat ki Namaz baith kar padhte na dekha yahan tak ke Aap budhe ho gae, phir baith kar qiraat karte yahan tak ke jab ruku karna chahte to khade hote aur tees ya chalis aayaton jaisa padhte phir ruku karte."
"310","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Madni Abdullah bin Yazeed se aur Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baith kar Namaz padhte they aur baith kar qiraat karte, phir jab Aap ki qiraat mein se tees ya chalis aayaton jaisa baqi rehta to khade hote aur khade ho kar qiraat karte phir ruku aur sajda karte, phir dusri rakat mein waisa hi karte."
"311","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Urwa bin Zubair aur Saeed bin Musayyab nafl Namaz guht mar kar baith kar padhte they."
"312","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Qaqa bin Hakeem se, unhon ne Ummul Momineen Aaisha ke ghulam Abu Yunus se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Aaisha ne mujhe hukm diya ke un ke liye mushaf likhun phir kaha ke jab is aayat par pahuncho to mujhe khabar dena ke Namazon aur darmiyani Namaz ki hifazat karo aur Allah ke liye farmanbardar khade ho. Phir jab main us par pahuncha to unhein khabar di to unhon ne mujhe likhwai ke Namazon aur darmiyani Namaz aur Asr ki Namaz ki hifazat karo aur Allah ke liye farmanbardar khade ho. Aaisha ne kaha ke maine ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha."
"313","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Amr bin Rafi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Ummul Momineen Hafsa ke liye mushaf likhta tha to unhon ne kaha ke jab is aayat par pahuncho to mujhe khabar dena ke Namazon aur darmiyani Namaz ki hifazat karo aur Allah ke liye farmanbardar khade ho. Phir jab main us par pahuncha to unhein khabar di to unhon ne mujhe likhwai ke Namazon aur darmiyani Namaz aur Asr ki Namaz ki hifazat karo aur Allah ke liye farmanbardar khade ho."
"314","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dawood bin Husain se, unhon ne Ibn Yarbou Makhzoomi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Zaid bin Sabit ko kehte suna ke darmiyani Namaz Zuhr ki Namaz hai."
"315","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Ali bin Abi Talib aur Abdullah bin Abbas kehte they ke darmiyani Namaz Fajr ki Namaz hai. Malik ne kaha ke Ali aur Ibn Abbas ka qaul is bare mein jo maine suna hai us mein sab se pasandida hai."
"316","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Umar bin Abi Salma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Umm Salma ke ghar mein aik kapde mein Namaz padhte dekha jab ke Aap use lapete hue they aur us ke dono kinare apne kandhon par rakhe hue they."
"317","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke aik sawal karne wale ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik kapde mein Namaz ke bare mein sawal kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum sab ke paas do kapde hain."
"318","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abu Huraira se sawal kya gaya ke kya shakhs aik kapde mein Namaz padhta hai, to unhon ne kaha ke haan. To un se kaha gaya ke kya tum khud aisa karte ho, to unhon ne kaha ke haan, main aik kapde mein Namaz padhta hun jab ke mere kapde khatti par hote hain."
"319","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Jabir bin Abdullah aik kapde mein Namaz padhte they."
"320","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm aik qamees mein Namaz padhte they."
"321","Mujhe Malik se Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo do kapde na pae wo aik kapde mein lapet kar Namaz padhe, phir agar kapda chhota ho to use tehband banae."
"322","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha qamees aur khimar mein Namaz padhti thin."
"323","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Zaid bin Qunfaz se, unhon ne apni walida se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma se sawal kya ke aurat kin kapdon mein Namaz padhe, to unhon ne kaha ke khimar aur lambe qamees mein Namaz padhe jab wo us ke qadmon ki pusht ko chhupa le."
"324","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne nazdeek siqa shakhs se, unhon ne Bukair bin Abdullah bin Ashaj se, unhon ne Busr bin Saeed se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Aswad Khaulani se riwayat kya, jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Maimuna ki parwarish mein they, ke Maimuna qamees aur khimar mein Namaz padhti thin jab ke un par tehband na hota tha."
"325","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke aik aurat ne un se fatwa manga aur kaha ke kamarband mujh par mushkil hai to kya main qamees aur khimar mein Namaz padhun, to unhon ne kaha ke haan jab qamees lamba ho."
